      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 2 Chapel Farm Close, Lusk to the property market. This very well-presented semi-detached home comes to the market with the added benefit of a spacious attic conversion, complete with en-suite bathroom, and is ideally positioned within a quiet, family-friendly development.\r\n\r\nUpon entering this impressive home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hall leading to a bright and inviting living room, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. To the rear of the property, the modern kitchen and dining area provides direct access to the spacious rear garden, making it ideal for outdoor dining and family activities. The ground floor is further enhanced by a convenient pantry. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property features three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous primary bedroom with en-suite, along with a contemporary main bathroom. The property is further complemented by a large attic conversion with its own en-suite bathroom, providing a versatile additional space that could be used as a home office, playroom, guest accommodation or further living space, subject to the necessary permissions where applicable.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated just a short distance from Lusk Main Street, where a wide range of amenities and services are within easy reach. The property is also only a few minutes' walk from the local bus stop, with multiple bus services operating from this location. Rush & Lusk Train Station is also within walking distance, providing convenient access for commuters.Lusk Village offers an excellent range of amenities, including local shops, four national schools, a secondary school and a variety of community and sporting clubs, including soccer, GAA and athletics. Lusk is a charming and picturesque village, conveniently located close to Skerries and Rush, while also offering easy commuting access to Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways and Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all this wonderful family home has to offer.\r\n\r\n**Disclaimer:** All information provided is to the best of our knowledge and has been carefully verified. However, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and recommend that viewers seek their own professional advice"
      },
